# The compose project's `.env` (workdir.nix links it to /var/lib/krg/fishsense/.env,
# where `docker compose --project-directory` reads it). Committed, non-secret.
#
# COMPOSE_PROFILES: which profile-gated services a converge starts. Empty: the
# core stack only. Set it to `superset` to run Superset + Valkey — only after
# docs/cutover.md's Superset step (migrate-v1 has made the lab, and a converge
# has bound the analytics login to it), then commit: the converge that follows
# starts them. `ops` (the smoke test) is never listed here; it runs by hand.
COMPOSE_PROFILES=
